  "interpretation": "Pristine official MPI1 and MPI4 are not bitwise identical: 139/202 variables match exactly; 63 differ. PR21 RA4 MPI1 and MPI4 show the same exact field-level reproducibility pattern (139/202 exact, same 63 field names). This establishes that decomposition-dependent differences already occur in the official RRTMG4/UDM setup. At corresponding rank counts, pristine vs PR21 RA4 differs only in SR (201/202 exact); SR is the registered fraction-of-frozen-precipitation diagnostic and should remain separately reported. No extra variables or shape/dtype mismatches occur. These are short one-step results and do not identify the cause of decomposition sensitivity or establish long-run behavior.",
